 "text": "-->\nAuditor | Benton County\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nBENTON COUNTY\nAbout\nWelcome\nCommunity\nDepartments\nContact\nBusiness Info\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nCounty Government\nAll Departments\nAuditor\nServes as secretary to various elected and appointed boards; duties include preparing agendas, maintaining official records, collecting bids and much more. Advertises all public meetings, budgets, bids, tax sales and other information the County must release to the public. Oversees all county finances including budgeting, collection of receipts, multiple tax payments and more. Retains all personnel files, administers payroll, and employee benefit programs. Maintains records on property including the collection of property tax deductions, aerial plat books, etc.\nlowtaxinfo.com\nLOCATION\n706 E 5th Street; Suite 21 Fowler, IN 47944\nBenton County Courthouse\n(2nd Floor)\nHOURS\nMonday - Friday\n8:30 am to 4:00 pm EST\nClosed on major holidays\nCONTACT\nPhone: 765-884-0760\nFax: 765-884-2075\nADDITIONAL LINKS\nAssociation of Indiana Counties\nBenton County Council 2024 Schedule\nADDITIONAL DOCUMENTS\nApplications, Permits, and Zoning\nNotice of Tax Sale\n2025 Pay 2026 Tax Rates\n2024 Pay 2025 Tax Rates\n2022 Pay 2023 Tax Rates\n2021 Pay 2022 Tax Rates\n2020 Pay 2021 Tax Rates\nSTAFF\nBeth Budreau, Auditor\nbbudreau@bentoncounty.in.gov\nGail Holzer, Transfer Deputy\ngholzer@bentoncounty.in.gov\nCassie Brownfield – HR/PR Chief Deputy\ncbrownfield@bentoncounty.in.gov\nKelsey Knight - AP/AR Deputy\nkknight@bentoncounty.in.gov\nTOWNSHIP TRUSTEES\nAll Departments\nBENTON COUNTY COURTHOUSE\n706 E 5th Street\nFowler, IN 47944\nHours of Operation\nGENERAL NAVIGATION\nAbout\n​\nContact\n​\nCovid-19 Updates\n​\nEducation / Schools\n​\nGovernment\n​\nHistory\n​\nHome\n​\nJob Openings\n​\nPermits\n​\nUtilities\n​\nVoting Information\n​\nWelcome\n​\nCarbon Sequestration\nCOMMUNITY RESOURCES\nSee Also Community Departments\nADA & Title VI Resources\nLocal Experiences\nBusiness Directory\nEvents\n​\nHealth Department\n​\nLibraries\n​\nVeterans Affairs\nDEPARTMENTS\nAdministration\nAssessor​\nAuditor​\n​\nCentral Committees\n​\nCounty Clerk​\n​\nCommissioners​\n​\nCounty Council​\n​\nRecorder​\n​\nTreasurer\nCommunity\n​\nADA & Title VI Resources\nChamber of Commerce\n​\nBe In Benton\n​\nCooperative Extension Service ​\n​\nEconomic Development Department\n​\nBenton County Tourism\n​\nFamily & Children Division\n​\nRetirement Village\n​\nVeterans Affairs\nDEPARTMENTS\nHealth & Safety\n​\nDispatch - 911\n​\nEmergency Medical Services (EMS​)\n​\nHealth Department\n​\nHomeland Security &\nEmergency Mgt.​\n​\nSheriff's Department\n& Jail\nInfrastructure\n​\nAdvisory Plan\nCommission\nBuilding Inspector​\n​\nHighway Department\n​\nSoil / Water Conservation\n​\nSurveyor\nJustice\nCircuit Court\nProbation\nProsecuting Attorney\nOUR COMMUNITIES\nTown of Ambia\n​\nTown of Boswell\n​\nTown of Earl Park\n​\nTown of Fowler\n​\nTown of Otterbein\n​\nTown of Oxford\nHELPFUL LINKS\nSmart911 SignUp & LogIn\n​\nGIS Mapping: For property aerial maps, parcel assessment, and tax info.\n​\n2021 Indiana Municipal Guide\n​\nGuide to Securing your Home\n​\nVoter Information\n​\nIndiana Voter Portal\n​\nIndiana Office of Energy Development\n​\n2018 Benton County Comprehensive Plan\n​\nBest Colleges in Indiana 2022\n2025 Benton County Indiana All Rights Reserved\nWebmaster: Signature Web Creations\nbottom of page",
